  "description": "Ahn Oh-hu, who is bored with her ordinary self, discovers that her classmate Joo Sae-rok can stop time. An Ohu, who wants to be special herself, starts to lie to herself to be with Joo Sae-rok, and Joo Sae-rok decides to help An Ohu and spend their longest time together until winter.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=818188), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10344744)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003460)",
